# The CTS certificate pack is a deliberate, narrow exception to the *.p12 /
# *.pem rules above. These are internal-CA certificates for the MDES *test*
# environment, shipped so packaging works without a manual import; ART tracks
# the same material. Their passwords are NOT in this repository - the app keeps
# them in the OS credential store. See crs_generator/certificates/README.md.
# Everything outside this one directory stays ignored.
!crs_generator/certificates/**/*.p12
!crs_generator/certificates/**/*.pfx
!crs_generator/certificates/**/*.pem
!crs_generator/certificates/**/*.crt

# The exception above covers certificates only. Their passwords must never join
# them - a password file next to the keys turns committed test certificates into
# committed usable credentials. See SECURITY.md.
Passwords.csv
passwords.csv
**/Passwords.csv
**/passwords.csv
cts-passwords*

